<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>GamesIndustry.biz Latest Articles Feed</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/feed</link><description>This is a feed of the latest articles from GamesIndustry.biz.</description><atom:link href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/feed" rel="self"/><language>en</language><copyright>Copyright (c) GamesIndustry.biz a brand of IGN Entertainment, Inc.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:36:20 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Arknights: Endfield named Google Play's best game of 2026</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/arknights-endfield-named-google-plays-best-game-of-2026</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vikki Blake</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:36:20 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/arknights-endfield-named-google-plays-best-game-of-2026</guid><category>Google Play</category><category>GRYPHLINE</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Screenshot-2026-11-18-at-17.31.21.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Screenshot-2026-11-18-at-17.31.21.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Gryphline's Arknights: Endfield has been named Google Play's best game of 2026, taking the top prize in every market except Japan and Korea.</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/arknights-endfield-named-google-plays-best-game-of-2026">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>18 unsolicited third-party statistics about GTA 6</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/18-unsolicited-third-party-statistics-about-gta-6</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jon Hicks</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:03:10 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/18-unsolicited-third-party-statistics-about-gta-6</guid><category>Data</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/ULTIMATE_EDITION_WYMAN_CAR_COLLECTION_01.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/ULTIMATE_EDITION_WYMAN_CAR_COLLECTION_01.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Officially, GTA 6 releases on Thursday, the 19th November. In practice, the first players in New Zealand, or <a href="https://www.ign.com/articles/gta-6-new-zealand-trick-xbox-ps5-early-release-time">claiming to be in New Zealand</a>, fired it up on the 18th in the UK and US, and <a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-arrives-to-record-review-scores-and-streaming-audiences">dozens of reviews have been published worldwide</a>. Mainstream media coverage has been running all day, and will continue into the morning as the game goes on sale. In response to this highly anticipated global event, marketeers across the globe have deluged the world's media with uncertain claims of product relevancy.</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/18-unsolicited-third-party-statistics-about-gta-6">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>Sam Houser: with GTA 6, Rockstar "tried to create an experience that will exceed your expectations while showing what this medium is capable of"</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sam-houser-with-gta-6-rockstar-tried-to-create-an-experience-that-will-exceed-your-expectations-while-showing-what-this-medium-is-capable-of</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jon Hicks</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:56:30 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sam-houser-with-gta-6-rockstar-tried-to-create-an-experience-that-will-exceed-your-expectations-while-showing-what-this-medium-is-capable-of</guid><category>Rockstar Games</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-6-review.webp?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-6-review.webp?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Rockstar Games president and co-founder Sam Houser has issued a rare statement as GTA 6 launches, celebrating the game's debut and its <a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/grand-theft-auto-6-critical-consensus">glowing critical reception</a>.</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sam-houser-with-gta-6-rockstar-tried-to-create-an-experience-that-will-exceed-your-expectations-while-showing-what-this-medium-is-capable-of">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>GTA 6 arrives to record review scores and streaming audiences</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-arrives-to-record-review-scores-and-streaming-audiences</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jon Hicks</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:24:20 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-arrives-to-record-review-scores-and-streaming-audiences</guid><category>Rockstar Games</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-drinks.webp?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-drinks.webp?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>GTA 6 has already set records for critical response and streaming audience, even before formally releasing in much of the globe including Europe and the USA.</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-arrives-to-record-review-scores-and-streaming-audiences">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>Build a Rocket Boy pursuing litigation against alleged "saboteurs" to repay £61.7m in debt</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/build-a-rocket-boy-pursuing-litigation-against-alleged-saboteurs-to-repay-617m-in-debt</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sophie McEvoy</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:56:40 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/build-a-rocket-boy-pursuing-litigation-against-alleged-saboteurs-to-repay-617m-in-debt</guid><category>Build A Rocket Boy</category><category>Legal</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/MindsEye_ZlzwQNY.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/MindsEye_ZlzwQNY.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>MindsEye developer Build a Rocket Boy owes &pound;61.7 million in debt, which it plans to recoup by pursuing litigation against alleged "saboteurs".</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/build-a-rocket-boy-pursuing-litigation-against-alleged-saboteurs-to-repay-617m-in-debt">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>Grand Theft Auto 6 | Critical Consensus</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/grand-theft-auto-6-critical-consensus</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sophie McEvoy</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:38:20 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/grand-theft-auto-6-critical-consensus</guid><category>Critical Consensus</category><category>Grand Theft Auto VI</category><category>Rockstar</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gtavi_18.jpg.webp?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gtavi_18.jpg.webp?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>After a 13-year wait, Grand Theft Auto 6 has been met with universal acclaim. Despite a lead-up marred by <a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-delayed-to-26-november-2026-for-additional-polish"> delays</a> and <a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/group-behind-gta-6-leaks-threatens-to-release-alleged-full-build-of-game-including-story-mode"> leaks</a> the hype has only grown, with over 17 million pre-orders generating more than $1.6 billion in revenue, according to <a href="https://sensortower.com/grand-theft-auto-VI/sales-tracker"> recent data</a>.</p> <p><a href="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/grand-theft-auto-6-critical-consensus">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item>
